Z||000023||Dumba$$||12-05-2001||11:20 AM||||my 2.8 stock was a baseline of 178hp  i estimate with the chip and exhaust intake tb.  and all of the other  bs i had done to it id say i had about 235hp at the fly wheel of course  <BR>oh ya,this is my 97' vr6 jetta im talking about <BR>the speedo toped out at 160 i took it up to 150mph before i got freeked out  at 150 i still had 400rpm to redline in 5thgear  if i remember right redline was at 7800rpm boy you get to 130-150mph the car just smoothed out and felt like riding on air!!  that car was fast!<BR>   i raced Gtbastard's 86se (the one that used to be owned by 1fst2m6) and he got me off the line but then at about 45mph i blew by him i think he topped out at about 90mph <BR>and i had about 5 car lengths on him by the time he was topped out <BR>vr6's are one hell of a motor <P>i was dumb and traded that for my 98' acura cl3.0  i wish that i never got rid of my jetta   the cl is still one hell of a nice car ride and comfort wise and it is still quick but it is more of a luxuary car and it is has a very squishy suspension so it dosent feel as fast!<BR>the cl is basicly the same engine as the accord v6's butt the use a dif. design head im told which gives it 220hp at the flywheel vs. 200hp in an accord <P>ok im done babbling<BR>||||reg||1
